  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "This paper explores the use of diffusion models as plug-and-play modules, allowing for efficient inference across domains and tasks, while addressing the intractable posterior inference problem in diffusion models. RASteer introduces concepts for erasure in diffusion models, while DUNE introduces new methods to refine diffusion networks for lower noise. Fewer tokens and smaller cache are highlighted as key innovations in efficient reasoning.",
